<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst Skip Carpenter said Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc was removed from the firm's recommended list and is now rated market performer.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- on Wednesday the brewer said its U.S. market share was flat for the first six months of the year.  It also said its earnings growth for 1997 would be below its long-term goal of double-digit increases.</p>
</text>
